+    So prepend a symlink farm of the ``vllm_ascend`` package whose
+    ``_build_info.py`` is a real file with upstream's SOC-less content.
+    Everything else resolves through the symlink to the real tree
+    (tracebacks keep pointing at the graded sources).  The tree under
+    test is never modified — the untouched-guard stays clean, the e2e
+    lanes keep their a3 profile, and nothing recompiles (CPU-sim never
+    loads the custom-op .so files).  A3-specific tests patch the profile
+    in-test (as upstream's do), so A3 coverage survives.  Disable with
+    MAIN2MAIN_UT_PURE_CPU=0 to grade the tree's own build profile.
